{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他突然开始害怕对方有一天不再需要自己陪，因此安静下来；但两人眼下仍然亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担忧、紧绷，又有一点高兴和安心。\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间小字里的声音变化、薄雾、夜空等具体画面，以及“不安没答案，却暂时不占满心思”这一情绪转折；右侧前四个阶段标签也不容易一眼读到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他忽然担心自己有一天会变得不再被对方需要，但对方此刻仍在身边，两人依然亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、害怕失去、克制、略感欣喜。\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间三行小字所描述的情绪变化和声音、光线、夜空等意象，需要仔细读才能理解；右侧阶段列表的前几步也容易被忽略。下方较大的金色圆点容易吸引视线，但不能直接读出具体情绪。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他开始害怕对方以后不再需要自己，虽然不敢往远处想，但也知道两人现在仍然亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、犹豫、害怕失去，同时有一点高兴和释然。\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间小字中从冲动收住到逐渐平静的过程，以及薄雾、余响、夜空等画面细节不容易扫到；“不安没答案，却暂时不占满心思”尤其容易漏掉。右侧前四个阶段也需要逐条看。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"核心叙事其实是连贯的：害怕不再被需要，所以忽然安静；看到对方仍然亲近，又产生一点高兴。但上半屏同时放了很长的紫色标题、三行密集的小字、两块较大的灰色和金色陈述，右侧还有五级阶段列表，存在多个信息入口。第一眼能抓到害怕失去和眼下仍然亲近，却不容易同时抓到中间那层情绪转折及其对应的雾、余响、夜空画面。下方金色动画有氛围，但抽象圆点和线条没有明确对应到人物处境，因此故事和感受比具体画面更容易串起来。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9571e4b7-7e6d-479c-8ba2-807e8b568ef1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224357915301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.984, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:45:02.888466+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "47f374eda42fe5f8d3a78620f53838c5aff2407a8e5f30d2c503ff67f39dcecf", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224357915301Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c708c35caefbf0a86ecc37006b809cc29098502459976022b6c85f93c49409b4"}}}
